ique outfits and accessories, adding a personal touch to every run.\n\nPet Runner offers fast-paced gameplay that\u2019s engaging and easy to pick up, while still providing dynamic challenges to keep you coming back for more. Compete against your high score or challenge friends to see who can go the furthest, delivering endless entertainment. With stunning visuals, responsive controls, and ever-changing obstacles, it\u2019s the perfect game for quick sessions or extended play.\n\nReady to take on the challenge? Jump into the action and experience the thrill of the race. Download Pet Runner now and join the fun!", "short_description": "Embark on an exhilarating adventure in Pet Runner! Dash through dynamic environments, collect coins, and navigate challenging obstacles. Choose your favorite pet and customize their look as you aim to achieve your highest score. Designed for both quick sessions and extended play, Pet Runner delivers excitement and fast-paced action for players seeking a thrilling experience. Unlock powerful upgrades and compete with others on the leaderboard. Ready to test your skills? Download Pet Runner now an"}]}, "developer_name": "Esti Soft", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nRyME7ipZKdK4JPdh6Aza7RPKWnEWmNI/view", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Esti Soft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.bilgiplatformu.net/post/pet-runner", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "673385183287495"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supporte